sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as ROS 2 Client
    participant N as adi_iio node
    participant H as libiio ctx / IIO HW
    C->>N: ListEventAttributes()
    N->>H: enumerate every device + channel in the context
    H-->>N: event attribute names
    N-->>C: success + device_attrs[] + channel_attrs[] (iio_path strings)
    Note over C,N: unlike ListAttributes, this scans the whole context - no path parameter
